    "Deleted records (is_deleted = 1) should normally be excluded from reporting.",
    "created_date is the preferred date column for period-based reporting.",
    "Use rating for monetary or quantity totals.",
    "Join to Client, Crm Client Type, Dealer through the foreign key columns to resolve names."
